<title>ITALY: TENNIS-BOLOGNA INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BOLOGNA INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BOLOGNA, Italy 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bologna International men's clay-court second round results on Thursday (prefix number denotes seed):</p>
<p>1-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) beat Albert Portas (Spain) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>8-Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) beat Jacobo Diaz (Spain) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Andrea Gaudenzi (Italy) beat Franco Squillari (Argentina) 4-6 6-4 7-6</p>
<p>2-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat Fernando Meligeni (Brazil) 6-7 7-5 6-2</p>
</text>
